## The runtime

This game stands on no engine, so the runtime under it is yours to write: the
frame loop and the delta time it measures, the canvas fit, the keyboard and a
pointer a mouse, a pen, and a finger all drive, audio cues, loading the produced
art and sounds, and the debug overlay. Where this specification speaks of the runtime it means that
layer, and it states only what Facet needs from it. How the layer is structured
is yours to decide.
